>\n<p>蔡天鳳命案中主謀一家背景？<i></i></p>\n<p>蔡天鳳好友豹太日前接受《東張西望》訪問時透露，懷疑遇害主因涉及兇手一家居住的加多利山豪宅，更透露兇手一家經常在內地花費的情況驚人⋯⋯<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e8%a5%bf%e6%9c%9b-%e8%b1%b9%e5%a4%aa-plt7-1475077/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">詳情請看</a></b></p>\n<p>蔡天鳳為何聘請前夫兄長做司機？<i></i></p>\n<p>蔡天鳳好友豹太日前接受《東張西望》訪問時透露，Abby大伯是今年農曆年才做Abby司機，而且是因為有人慫恿⋯⋯<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3-%e6%9d%b1%e5%bc%b5%e8%a5%bf%e6%9c%9b-%e8%b1%b9%e5%a4%aa-plt7-1475077/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E8%94%A1%E5%A4%A9%E9%B3%B3tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">詳情請看</a></b></p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T17:25:15.838677+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2640,"images":1,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T16:00:27+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T21:01:25.901114+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T17:18:39.983686+00:00","content_hash":"e94287ac28e8015329814659b210cd5548cfd5dd9ef776d610218e6c08c7ddce","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}